## Schleifen und Rekursionen in  Minecraft
## Code example for my Youtube tutorial videos
## Video: preparing

## start.mcfunction
## Call over commandblock
scoreboard objectives remove tutorials.schleifen.rekursion
scoreboard objectives add tutorials.schleifen.rekursion dummy

scoreboard objectives setdisplay sidebar tutorials.schleifen.rekursion

scoreboard players set _counter tutorials.schleifen.rekursion 0

tellraw @a [{text:"Start des Tutorials Rekursion"}]

tellraw @a [{text:"File: start.mcfunction, vor Rekursion"}]

function schleifen:rekursion/rekursion

tellraw @a [{text:"File: start.mcfunction, nach Rekursion"}]

function schleifen:rekursion/ende

## rekursion.mcfunction
execute if score _counter tutorials.schleifen.rekursion matches 0 run tellraw @a [{text:"File Rekursion - Start"}]
execute if score _counter tutorials.schleifen.rekursion matches 1.. run tellraw @a [{text:"File Rekursion - Wiederholung"}]

tellraw @a [{text:"File Rekursion: Scoreboardwert: "}, {score:{objective:"tutorials.schleifen.rekursion",name:"_counter"}}]
scoreboard players add _counter tutorials.schleifen.rekursion 1

execute unless score _counter tutorials.schleifen.rekursion matches 5.. run function schleifen:rekursion/rekursion


tellraw @a [{text:"File Rekursion - Ende mit Scoreboardwert: "}, {score:{objective:"tutorials.schleifen.rekursion",name:"_counter"}}]



## ende.mcfunction
tellraw @a [{text:"Ende der Rekursion"}]

tellraw @a [{text:"File: ende.mcfunction, Scoreboardwert: "}, {score:{objective:"tutorials.schleifen.rekursion",name:"_counter"}}]

